      "props": {
        "title": "Root Cause",
        "message": "On Aug 23, the heartbeat miscounted PR #56's age as ~57h when it was actually ~77h — missing the 72h staleness threshold on the first run. The rerun caught it at ~82h. The LLM was computing hour differences from ISO 8601 timestamps manually, which is inherently unreliable.",
        "type": "info"
      }
    },
